---
// Home hero stage (Three.js, scroll-driven). Logic lives in src/scripts/orb-hero.ts.
import { langOf } from '../lib/i18n';
const en = langOf(Astro.url) === 'en';
---
<div class="orb-stage">
  <canvas class="orb3d" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="orb-fallback" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <p class="sr-only">{en
    ? 'A sphere standing for Trust Gateway rises from the dark, with specks of light around it. A blue light for the PC and an orange light for the phone circle it, and each time they meet a glow of confirmation spreads over the sphere. As you scroll down, the sphere fades until only its outline is left below.'
    : '어두운 화면 아래에서 Trust Gateway를 뜻하는 구체가 떠오르고, 구체 둘레에 빛 입자가 떠 있습니다. PC를 뜻하는 파란 빛과 휴대폰을 뜻하는 주황 빛이 구체 둘레를 돌다가, 만날 때마다 확인의 빛이 구체에 퍼집니다. 아래로 내리면 구체가 점점 옅어지고, 아래쪽은 윤곽선만 남습니다.'}</p>
</div>

<style>
  .orb-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
  .orb3d { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1s var(--ease); }
  :global(.hero.is-ready) .orb3d { opacity: 1; }
  .orb-fallback {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -46vw; width: 76vw; height: 76vw; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 18%, #7fa6d8 0%, #3d6aa3 26%, #173156 60%, #0a1628 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 80px 10px rgba(120,170,235,.35), inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(170,205,245,.8);
    transition: opacity 1s var(--ease);
  }
  /* the flat CSS orb is only for pages without JavaScript or WebGL: while the 3D scene loads the stage stays dark
     and the copy rises in on its own, so the flat orb never flashes up before the real one */
  :global(html.js) .orb-fallback { opacity: 0; }
  /* WebGL failed or its context was lost: hide the dead canvas, bring the CSS orb back */
  :global(.hero.is-fallback) .orb3d { opacity: 0; }
  :global(.hero.is-fallback) .orb-fallback { opacity: 1; }
</style>

<script>
  import { orbHero } from '../scripts/orb-hero';
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.hero');
  if (root) orbHero(root);
</script>
